.TH SETUIDGID 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
setuidgid \- run a program with another account's identity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B setuidgid
.I account program
.RI [ argument ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Resolves the account, drops supplementary groups and process privileges to
that account, then replaces itself with the requested program. It must start
with sufficient privilege to change identity.
